      {
        "id": "book003-b000254-p000-7eddcf7cee",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "砂丘如同狼群湧動，水流交錯如魚鱗般層層簇擁向外，誰能試探其來時的痕跡？真正的龍脈出身時，其送從的砂丘夾輔推擁，如同浪湧一般重重疊疊，順著水流方向延伸，絕無回頭或反背的形勢。水從砂丘間流去，如同魚鱗般或分或合，或合後又分，像魚鱗交錯般隨砂而行，滔滔向外流去，不蓄積也不聚攏。這就是真龍出身的形勢，這種形體豈是容易得到的？如今的術師，一見到砂頭方正，便指點說這是某龍某穴，豈不知龍有真體，出身發足有住與不住之分，有正龍與傍龍之別，有真氣與僞氣之異。能透過望砂來點穴，才算悟道。水勢如同橫張的弓，砂勢猶如動盪的馬軍，軍屯戟列，誰知止駐紮的縣境所在？",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000255-p000-b1f191636b",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "真龍到達頭部時，其送從的旁砂隻隻回頭相隨，猶如勒住馬匹。四水交流，過堂橫聚，環抱如弓案，應龍虎側列如戟，屯伏如軍。有此形勢，方見真龍止駐不去，乃是結地。如今的術者，一見砂頭水面方正，不問水之合流交會，竟從點穴，這也是誤人。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000256-p000-681e82fbd6",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "大凡真龍結穴，不在長流之旁，也不出大水之門，多結於兩水夾流之中。傍有護送砂魂送從而來，宜主入首之處，群砂願局，或展開作案，或纏繞，或遶外遮後擁，必不出身露體、獻頭露面以洩真氣。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000257-p000-9e1a897d80",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "古人說：好龍卻是闥中女，帳幕藏身不露體，正是這個意思。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000258-p000-1fe1c8ee15",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "龍未住時，其來如逐龍；龍住時，其止如伏。左砂右歸，右砂左蹈，眾水朝堂，群龍躡足。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000259-p000-0c84407518",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "真龍未住時，其勢逐逐而行，不容止也。及其住也，其勢即伏靜而不動。左砂到堂向右，或右砂過堂向左，四畔環抱，明堂其送從之砂躡足而朝拱護齋。如此方是真龍住歇之勢。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000260-p000-d6a13f6144",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "注氣疑神，璧招之而不來，前關後鑽將拒之而不去。砂願水朝則氣淫而不行，神凝而不散，靜而不動。其止如伏。言右關攔，前後擁護周密，招之不來，拒之不去。真龍入首之勢如此。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000261-p000-1aac15e046",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "故知水交砂會之方，乃見真龍入首之地。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000262-p000-bdc1ca3f5d",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "水交於局前，砂會於左右，此見龍勢歇泊之處。而尋龍必須先看其局，前後左右之勢何如，然後詳其體制之美惡，方可以得其情狀吉凶休咎之述也。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000263-p000-d257e703f7",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "勢或消消，情猶赴海，鴉飛雁影，極目天涯。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000264-p000-2fd309ca5e",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "玉天大卷王上四。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000265-p000-f8feeda355",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "消消赴海，言水去而不聚；鴉飛雁影，言沙去而不頭。此四句將以發龍行未住之勢，如下文所云：疏神渙散則不歸，龍尚去而不住。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000266-p000-8b6102a6a1",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "龍之留去，觀水之行。止水行則龍行，水聚則龍住。故水神渙散不收，則知龍尚行去而未見其止泊也。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000267-p000-b6bfe013e1",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "微垣星散而不願，氣尚行而未收。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000268-p000-959d17fbcb",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "龍氣凝住，在傍砂揖伏展關而後可見。若微垣像列，群砂向外而不顧堂局，則知氣尚行而未見其或開門立面，須知風翼游鱗。龍行而不住，氣去而未收。中有砂頭分布，門面似有穴場可指點者，此不過行龍上分枝結耳，非氣鍾大地。如風林宿鳥，焉有寧翼？急水游魚，豈有雜解？雖有發福，非久長也。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000269-p000-c6ca01b3ef",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "總然蓄水為關，亦是斬慶截氣。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000270-p000-2dde0874f3",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "真龍出身中間，或得木聚之處，分頭立面，或被水插肩破腹，立頭面。此等塲穴，亦是斬截龍腰，俶氣王人無。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000271-p000-6c15bc6668",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "立穴之法，耳終非正龍自止氣蓄之地也。如此形勢，必得目力之巧，心思之深者，善能作用，不失其法而獲福也。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000272-p000-9ffc112c60",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "長砂展布，取一節于枝流。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book003-b000273-p000-60933385fb",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "長砂直出，隨水而去，去如席之展，無有地界收，不可立穴。中間有枝水插破其腹，勾取其氣入局者，亦斬腰截脈之法也。大塊鋪氊，求至配合。",
